        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanene b’egesaku kia Gileadi mosinto o Makiri mosinto o Manase abwo barenge korwa ase chinyomba chie egesaku kia Yusufu bagaacha na gokwana ase obosio bwa Musa, boigo ase abarai amo na abateneneri b’echinyomba chia Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagateeba, “ekero Omonene Nyasae aruete ogochika buna ebisaku bigaberwe emegondo buna omwando obo ase obomera, nigo ateebete omwando o Selofehadi oegwe abaiseke baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eraisa koba barabwo banywomirwe nabaanto b’ebisaku na omwando oyio obo korwa ase emegondo yaito ementeranigwe ase ebisaku biria basokerete; igo omwando bw’egesaku giaito nigo okoirwa korwa ase tore?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo ekero omwaka bw’echubiri ase Abaisraeli, engaki eria chinibo chionsi chiebisakore chikoiranerigwa abanyene, nenyarekane omwando ase abaiseke ba Selofehadi oriegwe na abasacha babo korwa ase ebisaku bia isiko”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene akarua ogochika ase Musa ogoteeba; ayio nekeene abanto b’ororeria rwa Yusufu bagokwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko nakwo ogochika ase abaiseke ba Selofehadi, barabwo ’mbare nobosibore konywomwa na monto onde bwensi banchete, korende omonto oyio goika arue ase egesaku kiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase enchera eyio omwando bw’egesaku ekemo tokonyara koirwa n’egesaku kende ekeao. Naboigo kera Omoisraeli narende omwando oye omotungetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omoiseke ore omonyamwando ase egesaku kia Abaisraeli goika anywomwe ase omonto bw’egesaku kiaye, erio kera Omoisraeli anyare konyora omwando korwa ase ororeeria rwe chisokoro chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, nenyarekane ng’a omwando bw’egesaku ekemo tokonyara koirwa n’egesaku kende ekeao. Kera egesaku ase Abaisraeli ’nkenyare koegerera omwando oye ogetungetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaiseke ba Selofehadi bagakora buna Omonene Nyasae amochiigete Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaiseke obwo ba Selofehadi; Maala, Teresa, Ogila, Milika, amo na Nuhu bakanywomwa n’abamwabo korwa are ororeeria rwa ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanywomwa gochia ase emechie y’ororeria rwa Manase mosinto o Yusufu erio omwando oise ogatigara ase egesaku kiabo ime ase enyomba yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amachiiko n’emeroberio y’Omonene Nyasae, buna biaruetwe gochia ase Abaisraeli, goteera ase Musa agwo ase ense omweya ya Moabu ng’umbu y’orooche rwa Yorodani ang’e n’omochie o Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
